Here's an example SAS code:
```sas
ods pdf file="my_journal.pdf" journal;
ods fontheight = 12pt;
ods paper = letter;

proc print data=sashelp.cars;
  title "Car Characteristics";
  var make model mpg;
run;

ods pdf close;
```
